<title>HONG KONG: Shui Hing interim net loss HK$10.54 mln.</title>
<headline>Shui Hing interim net loss HK$10.54 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended August 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   16.0 loss  vs 9.0 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	  vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    10.54 loss vs 5.85 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     127.00     vs 153.49</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shui Hing Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 12-16</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Shui Hing operates department and speciality stores and supermarkets and is engaged in property investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
